				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Let’s start with the \"corner–opposite-edge\" fork, one of the most common X strategies."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:18:14.628925+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:21:49.091666+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "hFbxWjj+DQCjtrr+D6r8qg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "If X plays in a corner and opposing edge, then X threatens to win by forking in the next move to the intersection corner. E.g.:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:20:26.940477+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:20:52.045668+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "ZUTUYjj+DQCmbZX5D6r8qg=="
				},
				"code" : "Gt4BpTicTacToeGame\r\twithEvents: {\r\t    Gt4BpEvent new\r\t\t\tname: 'moveAccepted';\r\t\t\tdata: {'player' -> 'X'.\r\t\t\t\t\t'row' -> 1.\r\t\t\t\t\t'col' -> 1} asDictionary.\r\t\tGt4BpEvent new\r\t\t\tname: 'moveAccepted';\r\t\t\tdata: {'player' -> 'O'.\r\t\t\t\t\t'row' -> 2.\r\t\t\t\t\t'col' -> 2} asDictionary.\r\t\tGt4BpEvent new\r\t\t\tname: 'moveAccepted';\r\t\t\tdata: {'player' -> 'X'.\r\t\t\t\t\t'row' -> 3.\r\t\t\t\t\t'col' -> 2} asDictionary}"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:21:04.675588+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:21:46.713982+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "LQ8UZTj+DQCmfhwTD6r8qg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "To prevent that, O must play to the intersection corner to prevent the potential fork."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:22:46.86802+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:22:51.768134+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "vrCKajj+DQCvMjltDR2sEg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "##Behavior encoding as b-threads"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:22:53.925874+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:24:00.508621+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "JxSXazj+DQCv6WjbDR2sEg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Following our **stateless design**, we can describe the fork-prevention logic as a set of pattern-based b-threads, each corresponding to a potential fork configuration.\n\nEach b-thread *\"watches\"* for a specific sequence of events (moves) and, when matched, requests moves to prevent the threat."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:23:56.955221+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:24:26.363701+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "gNZYbzj+DQCwR+q4DR2sEg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "As in previous cases we're going to programmatically generate these b-threads with Smalltalk code:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:24:35.011937+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T20:03:30.352084+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "h4mdcTj+DQCyW25oDR2sEg=="
				},
				"code" : "cornerEdges := {\r    { 1@1 . 3@2 } . { 1@1 . 2@3 } .\r    { 1@3 . 2@1 } . { 1@3 . 3@2 } .\r    { 3@3 . 1@2 } . { 3@3 . 2@1 } .\r    { 3@1 . 1@2 } . { 3@1 . 2@3 } }.\r    \rcornerEdgesPermutations := OrderedCollection empty.\rcornerEdges do: [ :moves |\r\tmoves permutationsDo: [:move | cornerEdgesPermutations add: move copy ].\r].\rintersectionCornerFor := [ :aPairOfSquares | \r\t| s1 s2 |\r\ts1 := aPairOfSquares first.\r\ts2 := aPairOfSquares second.\r    { 1@1 . 1@3 . 3@1 . 3@3 } detect: [ :aCorner | \r    \t(aCorner x = s1 x and: [ aCorner y = s2 y ]) or: [\r    \t\taCorner x = s2 x and: [ aCorner y = s1 y ]]\r    ]\r].\rcornerEdgesMoves := cornerEdgesPermutations collect: [ :xMoves | \r\t{ xMoves . intersectionCornerFor value: xMoves } flattened ]"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:35:20.220355+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T20:04:55.758197+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "Ua0SmDj+DQCSck0rDfaYWw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "For each of the previously calculated moves we define a specific b-thread watching the first 2 X moves and requesting the third move for O player:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:36:24.706836+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T20:42:01.153228+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "PJ/qmzj+DQCVNI6oDfaYWw=="
				},
				"code" : "bThreadsCornerOppositeEdgeFork := cornerEdgesMoves collect: [ :moves | \r\t'bp.registerBThread(\"XFork(', moves asString ,')\", function() {' , \r\tString crlf ,\r\t((moves copyFrom: 1 to: 2) flatCollect: [ :aPosition |\r\t    '    bp.sync({ waitFor: bp.EventSet(\"X', aPosition asString ,'\", function(e) {' , String crlf ,\r\t    '        return e.name == \"moveAccepted\" && ', String crlf ,\r\t    '            e.data.player == \"X\" && ' , String crlf ,\r\t    '            e.data.row == ', aPosition x asString , ' && ' , String crlf ,\r\t    '            e.data.col == ', aPosition y asString , '; ', String crlf ,\r\t    '         }) }); ' , String crlf\r\t]) ,\r\t'    bp.sync({ request: bp.Event(\"move\", { player: \"O\", row: ', moves last x asString , ', col: ', moves last y asString , ' }) }, 70); ', String crlf ,\r'}); ', String crlf , String crlf ].\r\rbtPreventCornerOppositeEdgeFork := String streamContents: [ :stream |\r\tbThreadsCornerOppositeEdgeFork do: [ :bThread | stream nextPutAll: bThread ] ]"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
